      },
      "Message": {
        "User": {
          "userId": "eid_48e149b5",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-23T23:41:00",
          "text": "I agree with David. The scripts and scheduling are well done, @eid_932ce89c. But ensuring the logs are monitored is crucial for catching any issues early. Also, I couldn't find the updated documentation for the backup procedures and schedules. Could you point me to it? 📚",
