      },
      "Message": {
        "User": {
          "userId": "eid_932ce89c",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-23T23:46:00",
          "text": "Thanks for the feedback, @eid_da6c2317 and Alice! I'll work on adding monitoring for the backup logs. As for the documentation, I must have missed updating it. I'll make sure to include detailed backup procedures and schedules. Appreciate the catch! 🙌",
